You must:

Use surrogate keys in all dimensions

Partition fact_streaming by DATE(event_ts)

Cluster fact_streaming by content_sk

Minimum rows in fact_streaming after full load: 60,000

SCD Type 2 Requirement

You must:

Simulate price changes for at least 2 plans in MySQL.

Reload into BigQuery.

Ensure:

Old version is closed (end_date set, is_current = FALSE)

New version inserted (new surrogate key, is_current = TRUE)

Incremental Load Requirement

You must:

Perform full load.

Insert 5,000 new stream_events into MySQL.

Run incremental load.

Run incremental load again.

After step 4, fact_streaming row count must not increase.

Analytics Queries

Run and record bytes processed for 4 queries:

Total watch hours by month

Top 10 most watched content

Average watch_seconds by subscription tier

Total watch hours by region and month

